<title>MEXICO: SOCCER-GUADALAJARA WIN MEXICAN CHAMPIONSHIP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GUADALAJARA WIN MEXICAN CHAMPIONSHIP.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-06-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Guadalajara beat Toros Neza 6-1 in the second leg of the Mexican soccer championship final on Sunday.</p>
<p>Guadalajara win 7-2 on aggregate</p>
</text>
